{"id":"84ea24a590d88f53","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-turing-jump.md","title":"Turing Jump","display":"df-turing-jump — Turing Jump","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-turing-jump","aliases":["58-df-turing-jump"],"display":"df-turing-jump — Turing Jump","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-oracle.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-turing-jump"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-turing-jump</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-jump — Turing Jump"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7f65c348d236e554\" href=\"?note=7f65c348d236e554\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md\">../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0724d9f2bd401655\" href=\"?note=0724d9f2bd401655\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-oracle.md\">../batch08/58-df-oracle.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a7e1b630ead60caa\" href=\"?note=a7e1b630ead60caa\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md\">../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^A\">\\(\\Phi_e^A\\)</span> 为内部固定编号的预言计算图。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\">\\(A&#39;\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K^A\">\\(K^A\\)</span> 保留原来的跳跃集记号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegisterEvaluation}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegisterEvaluation}_{58}\\)</span> 为内部有限执行关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}jump}\\vdash\nA&#39;\\coloneqq K^A\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\omega:\\exists y\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{RegisterEvaluation}_{58}(y,e,A,e)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}jump}\\vdash\nA&#39;\\coloneqq K^A\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\omega:\\exists y\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{RegisterEvaluation}_{58}(y,e,A,e)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\">\\(A&#39;\\)</span> is the halting problem relative to the oracle <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The diagonal definition is computably equivalent to the paired halting set but is not literally the same set.</li>\n<li>Transfinite jumps require an explicit system of effective ordinal notations at limit stages and are therefore not defined by a plain union here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&lt;_T A&#39;\">\\(A&lt;_T A&#39;\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\emptyset&#39;\">\\(\\emptyset&#39;\\)</span> is undecidable.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md","status":"resolved","id":"7f65c348d236e554","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-oracle.md","status":"resolved","id":"0724d9f2bd401655","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-oracle.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a7e1b630ead60caa","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_e^A","display":false},{"tex":"A'","display":false},{"tex":"K^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegisterEvaluation}_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}jump}\\vdash\nA'\\coloneqq K^A\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\omega:\\exists y\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{RegisterEvaluation}_{58}(y,e,A,e)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"A'","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A<_T A'","display":false},{"tex":"\\emptyset'","display":false}],"bytes":1097,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1331","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-turing-jump.md|58-df-turing-jump]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["7f65c348d236e554","0724d9f2bd401655","a7e1b630ead60caa"]}